Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["Index conventions and contraction path", "Title",
 CellID->509267359,ExpressionUUID->"22a1a762-10e3-861e-525e-3f4ca097ed64"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "This tech note pins down the index conventions the ",
 Cell[BoxData["Wolfram"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4da796ef-9f57-a4bf-7b5c-0fc91ae30e85"],
 "TensorNetworks`` kernel uses and shows how the ",
 StyleBox["same", "TI"],
 " contraction reads in each one. The conventions look alike (everything is a \
list of small integers) but they count different things, and conflating them \
is the usual source of confusion. We work computation-first: every claim \
below is produced by a cell you can rerun, and we read the meaning off the \
output rather than asserting it."
}], "Text",
 CellID->329621944,ExpressionUUID->"1b39f900-6440-cee7-4ac6-f16a0dfa94cd"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Five conventions appear. Four of them number ",
 StyleBox["legs",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 ", where a ",
 StyleBox["leg", "TI"],
 " is a single index of a tensor (one of its axes); one numbers ",
 StyleBox["operands",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 ", where an ",
 StyleBox["operand", "TI"],
 " is a whole tensor taking part in a contraction. The operands are not \
fixed: at the start they are the input tensors, and each contraction step \
replaces the two tensors it combines with their single result, so an operand \
can be an original input or an intermediate produced by an earlier step. \
Keeping the leg-versus-operand split in mind answers most questions on sight: \
when you see a list of integer pairs, ask \"pairs of ",
 StyleBox["what", "TI"],
 "\", legs or operands."
}], "Text",
 CellID->515379898,ExpressionUUID->"75d93363-5da6-51a4-23e6-ab4d5453238e"],

Cell[BoxData[GridBox[{
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "25a568a6-87a2-527f-535a-810032572145"], Cell["Convention", "TableText",
     FontWeight->Bold,ExpressionUUID->"00d7f70d-8d0e-ae34-30ec-ef5724b8f51e"],
     Cell["An integer means", "TableText",
     FontWeight->Bold,ExpressionUUID->"2f3e8453-9762-68ea-56c5-1e1d22173a30"],
     Cell["A contraction is written as", "TableText",
     FontWeight->Bold,ExpressionUUID->"5902d484-617f-9570-0f31-cdee100bfc5a"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "56e0e12c-de7d-6135-7e9f-f889db08301f"], Cell[TextData[{
     Cell[BoxData["EinsteinSummation"], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "5708d032-2150-04f2-7d37-ca7c50e56ed8"],
     " label"
    }], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"3b7807e8-9504-b25a-6907-9eb21cb600a0"], 
    Cell["an abstract name", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "166f8969-5e31-e8e5-3e14-21335bc5bacf"], Cell[
    "the same name on two tensors", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "234f1fb7-07c6-bba9-5174-96f1b27009f3"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "6ee45b93-a0df-d1f6-169c-52dcd16ba3dc"], Cell[TextData[{
     Cell[BoxData["TensorNetwork"], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "0a3edd72-e0d3-62fb-3bc5-d53f916630c1"],
     " data label"
    }], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"6ec9a758-58be-624c-16f6-3f02594b3096"], 
    Cell["a tensor-position, leg-label tag per leg", "TableText",
     ExpressionUUID->"23253b8d-1c99-a6bf-52da-b2d7952d0c85"], Cell[
    "a bond group (the legs sharing a label)", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "6e84829b-9667-6594-16bb-1bc523124ffe"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "569e173f-6b36-b240-7ea5-8f790ec000aa"], Cell[TextData[{
     Cell[BoxData["TensorContract"], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "15a3e88e-0b57-fa6e-4350-01e8aee3c8b4"],
     " global slot"
    }], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"779c57de-bb93-d239-1da4-4e983e27a103"], 
    Cell[TextData[{
     "a slot in the flattened ",
     Cell[BoxData["TensorProduct"], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "2867ea9b-6e8d-517b-581c-03c50b382041"]
    }], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"76dfbc62-92ac-7b6e-1ee4-364c275949b4"], 
    Cell["a pair of global slots", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "0df4b6a5-173c-e15a-3b8b-2f0fa2ceb3a0"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "4d620fc7-5cf2-d9d8-7b11-a6a15484ab22"], Cell[TextData[{
     Cell[BoxData["ArrayDot"], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "741b091d-feb2-1a39-1c38-a146fb476903"],
     " operand-local axis"
    }], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"3bf5a20e-c541-e06e-698a-446becf5b2b4"], 
    Cell["an axis within one operand", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "07964fa7-8d1e-ff14-2dae-660124a8c27e"], Cell[
    "a pair of operand-local axes", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "3e367b18-9aa8-58f9-67ce-73421f5d2ac3"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "1dbaaaf7-1388-e538-4b59-43b1a622cc02"], Cell[
    "contraction-path position", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "77d99fdb-a351-2d53-1de6-1684d6e477b9"], Cell[
    "a position in the operand list", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "04646437-faee-7dfc-2c1c-7e70fe9b47c6"], Cell[
    "a pair of operands to multiply", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "1cbde497-e826-5557-4442-fdd089d33fbd"]}
  }]], "3ColumnTableMod",
 CellID->604760901,ExpressionUUID->"6ecb37d0-fbcc-3e82-16c8-ae9dfe7e84e8"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Three of these four leg conventions give a leg a fixed identity, no matter \
how the network is contracted; the fourth, the ",
 Cell[BoxData["ArrayDot"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4c358d3e-86d3-ec5f-75ca-25783367b6a5"],
 " operand-local axes, is meaningful only during a contraction step. We build \
one small network, read its indices in those three fixed conventions, then \
see how a contraction path (operands) and ",
 Cell[BoxData["ArrayDot"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1f908cf3-3c70-d55a-45af-25bdb50abfa0"],
 " (operand-local axes) re-express the same sums, and close with the two \
cases a repeated index can take beyond a plain pairwise contraction: \
broadcasting and hyperedges. Each section re-creates the running network so \
it stands on its own."
}], "Text",
 CellID->1476799103,ExpressionUUID->"5dac66ba-272d-3627-0b54-7fe452d99d0d"],

Cell["Setup: one small network", "Section",
 CellID->448336599,ExpressionUUID->"110914de-bbdd-83a1-4736-8d983e69d18b"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "We use three tensors in a chain, with ",
 Cell[BoxData["EinsteinSummation"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "76d004f9-29e5-6665-1eef-9da34f904d4f"],
 " labels ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["i", "TI"], "=", "1"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2c76c797-c249-79ca-540d-ded0f7fc4b10"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["j", "TI"], "=", "2"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "35077f55-9291-6519-633d-771f27244c63"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["k", "TI"], "=", "3"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4ebf3687-f906-130d-7644-afe0f8b37e57"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["l", "TI"], "=", "4"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "65de4a87-3471-cd9f-13e6-63e1bd0597e5"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["m", "TI"], "=", "5"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7bedd9bd-1d84-ddaa-2992-d0e79436a7f0"],
 ": ",
 Cell[BoxData["t1"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4c37f35a-e1a6-07fe-75cc-eb0790536dc4"],
 " carries ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["i", "TI"], ",", 
    StyleBox["j", "TI"]}], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "02f88238-86c8-66df-3287-2462337d4c25"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData["t2"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "034d641c-5834-e412-3173-7e4659c6cf78"],
 " carries ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["j", "TI"], ",", 
    StyleBox["k", "TI"], ",", 
    StyleBox["l", "TI"]}], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "52ce4f6a-032d-a48b-02f6-6734b6d90ed1"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData["t3"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5bfe104a-50de-a555-0985-8a1461680fbf"],
 " carries ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["k", "TI"], ",", 
    StyleBox["l", "TI"], ",", 
    StyleBox["m", "TI"]}], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "134534fb-1061-d656-417a-ada5a115bcbc"],
 ". So ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["j", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2cd98fd2-34e7-e188-54e6-269cbc93b3d2"],
 " is a bond between ",
 Cell[BoxData["t1"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6e1c99a5-dcef-9c28-1623-100ed49be772"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData["t2"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "608e87cc-8fce-afdf-10b5-1e962a78f525"],
 ", while ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["k", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2aa912c6-4938-1bb7-5a56-8ba068cd699d"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["l", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "66b4bee0-d247-b105-0e4b-37cde7f3006f"],
 " are ",
 StyleBox["two", "TI"],
 " bonds between ",
 Cell[BoxData["t2"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "337c2d89-644e-5b5e-6103-c4d30dfb29a4"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData["t3"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5f7c2741-1c81-ec9b-0503-bf2b9535b6e1"],
 ", and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["i", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "644cc522-c7c4-9b18-0c73-dc8ff276e662"],
 " (on ",
 Cell[BoxData["t1"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2de8c8f9-eaf3-8e90-5b97-e1a28e87d4fa"],
 ") and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["m", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6801f052-da94-0b6f-183e-ea1fdf2159b5"],
 " (on ",
 Cell[BoxData["t3"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0daf8e98-7628-e40b-3b54-27c203c2cf51"],
 ") are the free legs. We ask for the output in the natural order ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["i", "TI"], ",", 
    StyleBox["m", "TI"]}], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7b6211f5-475c-1194-2911-88bf72e963fe"],
 ". We use symbolic arrays (",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["ArraySymbol"]], "paclet:ref/ArraySymbol"},
   "RefLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "7c8f7bdf-2493-8d8a-24b5-72994d27d7d0"],
 ") so the structural outputs display by name rather than as numbers."
}], "Text",
 CellID->970785311,ExpressionUUID->"14e8dcaf-74c9-37ba-3c97-d5097d7d9d80"],

Cell["Define the tensors and the network:", "Text",
 CellID->1377816002,ExpressionUUID->"5d5cbd3a-e88d-ee42-0b63-35678939b4a8"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"t1", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"ArraySymbol", "[", 
    RowBox[{"\"\<t1\>\"", ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"2", ",", " ", "3"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", " ", 
  RowBox[{"t2", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"ArraySymbol", "[", 
    RowBox[{"\"\<t2\>\"", ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"3", ",", " ", "4", ",", " ", "5"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", " ", 
  RowBox[{"t3", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"ArraySymbol", "[", 
    RowBox[{"\"\<t3\>\"", ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"4", ",", " ", "5", ",", " ", "2"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{"tn", " ", "=", " ", 
  RowBox[{"TensorNetwork", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"t1", ",", " ", "t2", ",", " ", "t3"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", "2"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"2", ",", " ", "3", ",", " ", "4"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"3", ",", " ", "4", ",", " ", "5"}], "}"}]}], "}"}], " ", "->",
      " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", "5"}], "}"}]}]}], "]"}]}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[1]:= ",
 CellID->293863717,ExpressionUUID->"3b7fe4cc-5889-7f4e-6904-fd96593c4594"],

